" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/4f7abe6a322ffa20d4839cdb08244645.avif?t=1793192661\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/3e65512100652416f39c4a939b6c27a4.poster.avif?t=1793192661\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/3e65512100652416f39c4a939b6c27a4.webm?t=1793192661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/3e65512100652416f39c4a939b6c27a4.mp4?t=1793192661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the rent paid and you can start thinking bigger. Expand your operation, run multiple businesses, and unlock new merchandise and production opportunities. But rent keeps rising, and confiscated stock or a bad deal can leave you struggling to make the next payment. Every purchase needs to earn its keep <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/0b910efb389bfbf38365514fdc12fb29.avif?t=1793192661\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/d9ae14c65ecf5c7e99608e5e4b990195.poster.avif?t=1793192661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348910/extras/d9ae14c65ecf5c7e99608e5e4b990195.webm?t=1793192661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset